 ("(the airport closed on Saturday afternoon on a forecast of a direct hit and stayed closed through a night of 4-kt winds)", "(the airport was reported closed from Saturday afternoon with reopening planned for Monday morning; it stayed closed through Sunday night, when its own station recorded 0–4 kt)"),
 ("The hotel association had more than 12,000 visitors in the city during Simon at about 50% occupancy; all of them were sheltered in place or offered rebooking on the strength of a forecast line that was 50–100 km off. The sector's interest in a better one is not charitable.", "The hotel association reported more than 12,000 visitors in the city at about 50% occupancy; hotels activated their protocols under the official watch and warning, keeping guests in interior safe areas, offering rebooking and in some cases moving guests to Guadalajara by road. The sector's interest in a better forecast is not charitable."),
 ("Mexico's president said in June that the Pacific is the least-observed part", "Mexico's president said in June, as reported by Zeta Tijuana, that the Pacific is the least-observed part"),
